<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-JUN.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 25-JUN.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Peter, with 40 mph winds, is in the Philippine Sea near 16.5n/126.8e, moving north at 9 mph. It is expected to slowly gain strength, and continue northward, passing east of the northern Philippines. A few rain squalls may occur on Luzon, but the bulk of this system will be over water, threatening shipping with rough conditions.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
